      "title": "Upgrade body-parser 1.20.3 -\u003e 1.20.9: fixes 1 known vulnerability (highest severity: high).",
      "why": "The fix (1.20.3 -\u003e 1.20.9) is published on the same major version, but body-parser is not a package you list yourself and express@4.21.2 requires body-parser 1.20.3: the range excludes 1.20.9, so nox fix apply cannot move it. Either upgrade express@4.21.2 to a release that depends on a fixed body-parser, or force the version with an entry in package.json: \"overrides\": { \"body-parser\": \"1.20.9\" }",
      "severity": "high",
